    """Converts an index array to a signal array.

    Parameters
    ----------
    idx : array_like
        Index array.
    step : int
        Step size.

    Returns
    -------
    signal : ndarray
        Signal array.

    Notes
    -----
    This method uses Cython to speed up the computation.

    Benchmark for 1,000,000 loops (step=250000):
        - Cython: 18.61 s
        - Python: 31.30 s
